@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### Organiser login: signs in as a seeded organiser so we can create events (expect 200 + token)
# @name orgLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "asha@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### User login: signs in as a normal user to test role checks (expect 200 + token; register test@example.com in auth.http first)
# @name userLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Create event as organiser: organisers are allowed to create events (expect 201)
# @name createEvent
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/events
Authorization: Bearer {{orgLogin.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Test Concert",
  "venue": "VIT Auditorium",
  "city": "Chennai",
  "startTime": "{{$datetime iso8601 1 M}}",
  "rows": 5,
  "seatsPerRow": 8,
  "pricePaise": 49900
}

### Create event as normal user: logged in but wrong role, so it must be forbidden (expect 403)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/events
Authorization: Bearer {{userLogin.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Test Concert",
  "venue": "VIT Auditorium",
  "city": "Chennai",
  "startTime": "{{$datetime iso8601 1 M}}",
  "rows": 5,
  "seatsPerRow": 8,
  "pricePaise": 49900
}

### Create event with missing title: validation must reject incomplete data (expect 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/events
Authorization: Bearer {{orgLogin.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "venue": "VIT Auditorium",
  "city": "Chennai",
  "startTime": "{{$datetime iso8601 1 M}}",
  "rows": 5,
  "seatsPerRow": 8,
  "pricePaise": 49900
}

### List events: public list of all events, no login needed (expect 200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/events

### List events with filter + pagination: only Chennai events, first page of 5 (expect 200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/events?city=Chennai&page=1&limit=5

### Get one event: fetches the event created above, including its seat map (expect 200 with 40 seats = 5 rows × 8; send Create event first)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/events/{{createEvent.response.body._id}}

### Get event with invalid id: "abc" is not a valid ObjectId (expect 400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/events/abc

### Get event that doesn't exist: valid ObjectId format but no such event (expect 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/events/000000000000000000000000
